{"id":"solo","lemma":"solo","pos":"adj","rank":69,"glosses":["sole; one; only; single (unique)","lonely, lonesome","alone, by oneself"],"ipa":"/ˈsolo/","forms":{"feminine":"sola","masculinePlural":"solos","femininePlural":"solas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/67/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-solo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Yo me encontraba solo.","en":"I was lonely.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/438136"},{"text":"No puedo ir sola.","en":"I can't go alone.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800471"},{"text":"Ustedes nunca estuvieron solos.","en":"You were never alone.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/455181"},{"text":"¿Podemos hablar a solas?","en":"Can we talk alone?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/444014"},{"text":"Solo pregúntale a Tom.","en":"Just ask Tom.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800253"}]}